stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> pending: commit intent<br/>and reservation
    pending --> completed: charge succeeded<br/>INSERT order
    pending --> failed: charge declined<br/>release stock
    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    note left of pending
      Leaving pending is always
      UPDATE ... WHERE state = 'pending'.
      Worker and sweeper may both try.
      One gets the row.
    end note
